From 7984b381f2c0e41ba25d2468dd52d0a594a8baa9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 06:44:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/39] Improve contact log: 9 types, notes field, history view
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add 9 contact types: Daily Chase, WA Sent, Responded, No Reply,
  Promised, Deposited, Reward, Inactive, Other (was 3 types only)
- Add notes textarea to the log popup — notes field was never
  populated from the UI before; now saves to campaign_player_contacts.notes
- Add contact history view: click the last-contact badge to see
  full history (up to 8 entries) with date, type, agent, and notes
- Show note preview on the badge (first line, italic, truncated)
- Add contactNote + contactHistory state; reset on closeModal
- All 3 log locations updated: Chase List, Payout tab, Inactive tab

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DqGp4gVeTBMvwho4pP8n8C
